2/5 years of experience with exposure to a broad range of Tax issues in international Tax law, contracts, Tax audits management, Tax reporting, financing in an international environment;
Experience within the e-commerce sector would be a plus;
Detail-oriented mindset;
Ability to work both independently and collaboratively;
Passion for making things happen and getting excited about identifying and delivering simple solutions to complex Tax problems;
Fluent in English both verbal and written;
Previous exposure to a multinational environment is a plus.
